RuneLite — crop decoding and growth timings
-------------------------------------------

src/main/resources/farming-crops.txt captures the supported herb, tree and fruit-tree values
from RuneLite 1.12.36's PatchImplementation.java and Produce.java. PatchStates reads this table
without reflection or a runtime dependency on RuneLite's farming plugin internals.

  PatchImplementation.java: Copyright (c) 2019 Abex
  Produce.java: Copyright (c) 2018 Abex

The full BSD 2-Clause notice and source URL are bundled beside the table in
src/main/resources/farming-LICENSE.txt. The same redistribution conditions and disclaimer
printed above apply. Automated tests compare each supported value and its growth timing with
the installed RuneLite client; writeFarmingDecode regenerates the table explicitly.


